<title>USA: Foodmaker to reduce debt.</title>
<headline>Foodmaker to reduce debt.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foodmaker Inc said Monday it would reduce its long-term debt by $50 million through the early redemption of a portion of its senior notes.</p>
<p>It said it expects to complete the transaction by the end of September, reducing its annual interest expense by more than $4.6 million.</p>
<p>Foodmaker operates and franchises 1,280 Jack in the Box restaurants.</p>
